    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464390/extras/4443c073e2c0f337818718180dab8ace.avif?t=1751484174\" data-has-big width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STONED is a  turn-based RPG about 3 stoners named Lil Bro, Big Bro and Cole who accidentally become possessed by the soul of an Ancient Cosmic Wizard. This leads to them finding out they have a prophesised duty to resurrect the Cosmic Wizard from the dead. But since they're too lazy to do all that, they decide to go on an adventure to find and collect 3 magical stones that can be used in a ritual to remove the Wizard's soul from them. Shenanigans ensue. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE TURN-BASED GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464390/extras/ff6791cbb6b3e814f04077831cb8bfa5.avif?t=1751484174\" data-has-big width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STONED features unique &quot;pong-style&quot; attack mechanics in its battle system in order to make the traditional turn-based combat more interactive and input based! You avoid enemy attacks by aligning yourself with their projectile and performing a certain action based on it's colour in order to deflect it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464390/extras/5a880fc3591650e5469a88da77b834ea.poster.avif?t=1751484174\" width=450 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464390/extras/5a880fc3591650e5469a88da77b834ea.webm?t=1751484174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464390/extras/5a880fc3591650e5469a88da77b834ea.mp4?t=1751484174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OTHER FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464390/extras/18b2975b2a5396764593b15eec289c10.avif?t=1751484174\" data-has-big width=800 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix of traditional and unique turn-based combat mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party-based RPG mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique story with both comedic and emotional themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of new areas with lots of items to find and NPCs to talk to</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical spells and other fantasy themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORD FROM THE CHARACTERS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COLE SAYS:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464390/extras/d937159f0e27ccabb7b4e7cdba523e5a.avif?t=1751484174\" width=104 height=138 /></span>\u00a0&quot;Please play this game so I can purchase some more loud&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCLAIMER:</strong> <strong>STONED features depictions and glorification of illicit drug use and addiction. However, Team Quivurr does not condone or endorse the illegal use of substances. This game is a work of fiction, and the actions of its characters are not intended as social commentary or advice of any kind.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464390/extras/4443c073e2c0f337818718180dab8ace.avif?t=1751484174\" data-has-big width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STONED is a  turn-based RPG about 3 stoners named Lil Bro, Big Bro and Cole who accidentally become possessed by the soul of an Ancient Cosmic Wizard. This leads to them finding out they have a prophesised duty to resurrect the Cosmic Wizard from the dead. But since they're too lazy to do all that, they decide to go on an adventure to find and collect 3 magical stones that can be used in a ritual to remove the Wizard's soul from them. Shenanigans ensue. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE TURN-BASED GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464390/extras/ff6791cbb6b3e814f04077831cb8bfa5.avif?t=1751484174\" data-has-big width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STONED features unique &quot;pong-style&quot; attack mechanics in its battle system in order to make the traditional turn-based combat more interactive and input based! You avoid enemy attacks by aligning yourself with their projectile and performing a certain action based on it's colour in order to deflect it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464390/extras/5a880fc3591650e5469a88da77b834ea.poster.avif?t=1751484174\" width=450 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464390/extras/5a880fc3591650e5469a88da77b834ea.webm?t=1751484174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464390/extras/5a880fc3591650e5469a88da77b834ea.mp4?t=1751484174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OTHER FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464390/extras/18b2975b2a5396764593b15eec289c10.avif?t=1751484174\" data-has-big width=800 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix of traditional and unique turn-based combat mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party-based RPG mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique story with both comedic and emotional themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of new areas with lots of items to find and NPCs to talk to</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical spells and other fantasy themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORD FROM THE CHARACTERS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COLE SAYS:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464390/extras/d937159f0e27ccabb7b4e7cdba523e5a.avif?t=1751484174\" width=104 height=138 /></span>\u00a0&quot;Please play this game so I can purchase some more loud&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCLAIMER:</strong> <strong>STONED features depictions and glorification of illicit drug use and addiction. However, Team Quivurr does not condone or endorse the illegal use of substances. This game is a work of fiction, and the actions of its characters are not intended as social commentary or advice of any kind.</strong></p>",
